/E ( Selling price is most positively correlated with max_power \(0.63\) and engine \(0.53\), and most negatively with vehicle_age \(-0.45\). km_driven has almost no linear relationship with price \(-0.05\). Engine and max_power are strongly related \(0.72\), and mileage falls as engine size grows \(-0.58\). The 'Unnamed: 0' row index shows no meaningful correlation. )
