407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (Overall learning. The CarDekho dataset was already clean: no missing values, no duplicates and consistent labels. The main data-quality issue was extreme high-end selling prices, handled with the IQR rule, which reduced the data from 15,411 to 14,025 rows. The analysis shows that listed price is mainly linked to engine power, vehicle age and transmission type, while the mix of listings is dominated by petrol and diesel cars from a few brands. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (Challenges faced. Deciding how to treat outliers without throwing away useful information, reading price relationships carefully without claiming causation, and keeping the conclusions inside what the columns can actually support. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
