411 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 538 0 R
/E (Only 4 electric, 44 LPG and 301 CNG cars are present, so nothing reliable can be said about these fuel types. Outliers were removed using the selling_price column only, which excludes premium and luxury cars from the later charts and statistics. Findings therefore describe mainstream used cars, not the whole market. Correlations measure linear association only and do not prove cause and effect. Price differences by transmission, for example, may also reflect differences in age, power or brand. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
