667 0 obj
<<
/Title (Observation: Higher max_power is generally linked with a higher selling price, but the spread is wide at every power level. The vertical stripes appear because many listings of the same model share an identical power value. A handful of cars above 300 bhp sell at modest prices and look like unusual records.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 545 0 R
/Next 731 0 R
