/Title (Observations: The mean selling price \(about 7.75 lakh\) is well above the median \(5.56 lakh\) and its standard deviation is larger than the mean, so price is strongly right-skewed. km_driven and engine show the same pattern \(mean above median\). Vehicle age, mileage, max_power and seats are close to symmetric, with the mean near the median.)
